{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","kind":"eigenquestions-fine-index","destinations":[{"id":"source-question:db4f2e2daec4b35a0a353f35cf82d79644af8fb8f18bb33bb4363e2f49ec1330","title":"The setting isolates pair creation by a classical electromagnetic background in a complex scalar field. Time dependence enters through the gauge potential, making even this quadratic matter theory a nonequilibrium problem.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0001"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:db642f6ba1ed046bfa2d96ceb8ac02f169f56068e832de717167edaf1fcb216a","title":"How do small-scale structure, loop production and massive radiation distribute energy in Abelian Higgs cosmic-string networks, and how can these networks scale without gravitational radiation?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0006"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:db4bc730c54326ce9b640dfafc3c6fe1cc02f0547beca21841e7406f5e59fccb","title":"How do bubbles form and collide in false-vacuum eternal inflation, and which collision effects could be observable in cosmology? This is an introductory, deliberately noncomprehensive review with one proposed new spacetime solution.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0011"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:db3c0815067a887beac482c92a83b982c2e58f3776e2dfe71c6d27dae33d85bc","title":"How do angular potentials induced by compactification affect DBI D3-brane trajectories and inflationary e-foldings when both the UV throat region and the smooth deformed-conifold tip are retained?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0011"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:db68ea18cc6780ae64ce58a93eb057ba638dd10f6176ea33a4b960fdba12d6bb","title":"Can dilaton-dependent non-perturbative effects at singularities generate tunable de Sitter minima within LVS from a manifestly supersymmetric effective 